his before and has been described as ‘The West End theatre event of the year’ (The Daily Telegraph).","seoDescription":"Buy tickets to Stranger Things: The First Shadow at the Phoenix Theatre in London's West End from the official box office of the show","trailer":"https://youtu.be/iJWE8j20TRs","duration":"3 hours ","hasInterval":true,"showTimes":["Tue - Sat at 19:00","Fri and Sat at 13:00","Sun at 15:00"],"doorsTimes":"","ageGuidance":"Recommended 12+. Under 5s not permitted. Under 16s must be accompanied by an adult. The production contains gunfire audio, loud noises, explosions, haze, smoke, flashing lights & strobe, strong language & depictions of mental health conditions & disorders","hideAgeGuidance":false,"why":"Brought to life by a multi-award-winning creative team, Stranger Things: The First Shadow is set within the mythology and world of Netflix's hugely popular series.","quotes":[{"content":"The West End event of the year","by":"The Daily Telegraph"},{"content":"This is breathtaking theatre","by":"The Guardian"},{"content":"Spectacular. Full of enough thrills, scares and knowing nods to please fans and the uninitiated in equal measure","by":"Evening Standard"}],"description":"\u003cp>Experience Hawkins in a whole new way at the \u003cstrong>Phoenix Theatre\u003c/strong> in the West End with \u003cstrong>Stranger Things,\u003c/strong> live on stage.\u003c/p>\u003cp>Witness the story of young Jim Hopper, Bob Newby and Joyce Maldonado, as they navigate the regular worries of a small town in 1959. But when newcomer Henry Creel and his family try to start anew, they find that the shadows of the past are not so easily left behind.\u003c/p>\u003cp>This gripping new adventure takes theatrical storytelling and stagecraft to a whole new dimension. It will transport you right back to the beginning of the \u003cstrong>Stranger Things\u003c/strong> story, and may even hold the key to its end. Don't miss your chance to be a part of this thrilling production at the \u003cstrong>Phoenix Theatre\u003c/strong> in the heart of London’s theatre district, the West End.\u003c/p>\u003cp>\u003cstrong>Stranger Things\u003c/strong> features an original story by \u003cstrong>Kate Trefy\u003c/strong>, \u003cstrong>The Duffer Brothers\u003c/strong> and \u003cstrong>Jack Thorne\u003c/strong>, with direction from \u003cstrong>Stephen Daldry \u003c/strong>produced by \u003cstrong>Netflix\u003c/strong> and \u003cstrong>Sonia Friedman Productions\u003c/strong>. Don't miss out on the world premiere of what is sure to be the theatrical event of the year!\u003c/p>\u003cp>\u003cem>The play is set within the world and mythology of Stranger Things. A good guide would be to check if you and your party are comfortable with the level of content within the TV show. We would recommend 12+. Under 5s not permitted. Under 16s must be accompanied by an adult.\u003c/em>\u003c/p>\u003cp>\u003cem>This production contains gunfire audio, loud noises and explosions, haze and smoke, flashing lights and strobe, and strong language. There are depictions of various mental health conditions and disorders.\u003c/em>\u003c/p>\u003cp>\u003cem>Ticket resale is not permitted for this event. \u003c/em>\u003c/p>\u003cp>\u003cem>Readmission to the auditorium during the show cannot be guaranteed, you may be held for a period of time before being taken back to your seats.\u003c/em>\u003c/p>\u003cp>\u003ca href='https://atgtickets.com/gifts/gift-vouchers/purchase/personalise?inventoryDesignId=45AC9D5F-E180-4061-B5AA-12CFEC90FD6B&placement=stranger_things_show_page'>Unlock unforgettable theatre experiences with a Stranger Things Gift Voucher, redeemable across ATG Tickets. Buy your Gift Voucher here. \u003c/a>\u003c/p>","bodyAssets":[{"type":"image","src":"https://res.cloudinary.com/dwzhqvxaz/image/upload/v1760978345/Titles/Stranger%20Things:%20The%20First%20Shadow/PRJONE25_Q4_006_ATG_assets_for_new_creative_asset_6_1920x1080_no_text_V1.jpg","description":"Stranger Things Title Shot 1","caption":"","alt":""}],"credits":[{"avatarUrl":"https://res.cloudinary.com/dwzhqvxaz/image/upload/v1626434463/Icons/ATG_Generic_Avatar.png","actorName":"Kate Trefry","actorSchedule":"","characterName":"Writer & Original Story"},{"avatarUrl":"https://res.cloudinary.com/dwzhqvxaz/image/upload/v1626434463/Icons/ATG_Generic_Avatar.png","actorName":"The Duffer Brothers","actorSchedule":"","characterName":"Original Story & Creative Producers"},{"avatarUrl":"https://res.cloudinary.com/dwzhqvxaz/image/upload/v1626434463/Icons/ATG_Generic_Avatar.png","actorName":"Jack Thorne","actorSchedule":"","characterName":"Writer"},{"avatarUrl":"https://res.cloudinary.com/dwzhqvxaz/image/upload/v1626434463/Icons/ATG_Generic_Avatar.png","actorName":"Stephen Daldry","actorSchedule":"","characterName":"Director"},{"avatarUrl":"https://res.cloudinary.com/dwzhqvxaz/image/upload/v1626434463/Icons/ATG_Generic_Avatar.png","actorName":"Justin Martin","actorSchedule":"","characterName":"Co-Director"},{"avatarUrl":"https://res.cloudinary.com/dwzhqvxaz/image/upload/v1626434463/Icons/ATG_Generic_Avatar.png","actorName":"Miriam Buether","actorSchedule":"","characterName":"Set Designer"},{"avatarUrl":"https://res.cloudinary.com/dwzhqvxaz/image/upload/v1626434463/Icons/ATG_Generic_Avatar.png","actorName":"Brigitte Reiffenstuel","actorSchedule":"","characterName":"Costume Designer"},{"avatarUrl":"https://res.cloudinary.com/dwzhqvxaz/image/upload/v1626434463/Icons/ATG_Generic_Avatar.png","actorName":"Jon Clark","actorSchedule":"","characterName":"Lighting Designer"},{"avatarUrl":"https://res.cloudinary.com/dwzhqvxaz/image/upload/v1626434463/Icons/ATG_Generic_Avatar.png","actorName":"Paul Arditti","actorSchedule":"","characterName":"Sound Designer"},{"avatarUrl":"https://res.cloudinary.com/dwzhqvxaz/image/upload/v1626434463/Icons/ATG_Generic_Avatar.png","actorName":"Jamie Harrison","actorSchedule":"","characterName":"Illusion Designer & Visual Effects"},{"avatarUrl":"https://res.cloudinary.com/dwzhqvxaz/